CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract foo
^\[ptr_ok\.assigns\.\d+\] line 4 Check that g is assignable: FAILURE$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Functions called in contract clauses are instrumented, so that side effects in
them are detected: requires clauses must not assign to g.
